/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (In the retail industry, managing inventory efficiently is one of the biggest challenges businesses face. Overstocking products can increase storage costs and waste, while understocking can lead to missed sales opportunities and dissatisfied customers. As retail markets become more competitive and customer demand becomes harder to predict, businesses increasingly rely on data analytics and machine learning to improve inventory planning and decision-making.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
